1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,860
Big friends are two numbers that make ten together!

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:04,440
Nine and one.

3
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,040
Eight and two.

4
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:07,460
Seven and three.

5
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,180
Six and four.

6
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:14,740
When the ones rod has no room to add, a big friend helps us carry to the tens rod!

7
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,520
Alert at the ticket counter!

8
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,640
Twenty-nine plus one is stuck!

9
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:20,620
There's no room to add one.

10
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:21,820
Let's call a friend!

11
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,040
One's friend is nine!

12
00:00:26,660 --> 00:00:28,800
Take away nine, then add ten!

13
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:31,260
Twenty-nine plus one is thirty!

14
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:32,500
Next ticket, please!

15
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:33,660
Next ticket!

16
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,820
Thirty-nine plus two is stuck!

17
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:37,780
There's no room to add two.

18
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:38,780
Friend time!

19
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:42,860
Two's friend is eight!

20
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:45,480
Take away eight, then add ten!

21
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,060
Thirty-nine plus two is forty-one!

22
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:49,360
Line keeps moving!

23
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:52,520
Uh oh, sixty-eight plus three is stuck!

24
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,480
There's no room to add three.

25
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:55,680
Friend, now!

26
00:00:58,340 --> 00:00:59,920
Three's friend is seven!

27
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:02,580
Take away seven, then add ten!

28
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:05,260
Sixty-eight plus three is seventy-one!

29
00:01:05,620 --> 00:01:06,220
Ticket's out!

30
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:08,340
Last ticket before opening time!

31
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:10,540
Fifty-seven plus four is stuck!

32
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:12,560
There's no room to add four.

33
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:13,620
One more friend!

34
00:01:16,180 --> 00:01:17,720
Four's friend is six!

35
00:01:18,340 --> 00:01:20,400
Take away six, then add ten!

36
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:23,100
Fifty-seven plus four is sixty-one!

37
00:01:23,520 --> 00:01:24,860
Doors open, let's go!

38
00:01:25,420 --> 00:01:27,040
Every stuck number has a trick.

39
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:31,560
Learn them all with Abacus Kids — free on the App Store and Google Play!
